  "acceptance": [
    "A user can log in with phone 9999999999 and OTP 123456; a wrong OTP shows a clear error and protected routes redirect to login",
    "The app looks professional: one consistent theme, the ShopOrders name and logo, and no unstyled or broken screens",
    "The layout works at 360, 768 and 1280px with no horizontal scroll, bottom navigation on mobile and 48px minimum touch targets",
    "Mock data has at least 120 products, 10 categories and 3 distributors, and every listed API endpoint responds",
    "Search finds results for 'atta', 'आटा', 'aata' and the typo 'sugr', with suggestions, filters and sort working",
    "English, Hindi and Marathi are complete on every screen with zero hardcoded text and Intl formatting for currency, dates and numbers",
    "The full flow works: login, search, add to cart, checkout, order placed, order detail and reorder",
    "Every data screen has loading, empty and error states, and the offline switch shows a clear message",
    "Lint, tests and build pass with zero warnings, no console.log and no unused code",
    "The production bundle size is reported in the final report"
  ],
